{"number":88,"nameArabic":"الغاشية","nameTransliterated":"Al-Ghashiyah","nameTranslated":"The Overwhelming","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":26,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"88:1","textAr":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلۡغَٰشِيَةِ","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu alghashiyati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا تمہیں اُس چھا جانے والی آفت کی خبر پہنچی ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"88:2","textAr":"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٍ خَٰشِعَةٌ","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawmaithin khashiAAatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be humbled"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کچھ چہرے اُس روز خوف زدہ ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"88:3","textAr":"عَامِلَةٞ نَّاصِبَةٞ","transliteration":"AAamilatun nasibatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Working [hard] and exhausted"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"سخت مشقت کر رہے ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"88:4","textAr":"تَصۡلَىٰ نَارًا حَامِيَةٗ","transliteration":"Tasla naran hamiyatan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"They will [enter to] burn in an intensely hot Fire"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تھکے جاتے ہونگے، شدید آگ میں جھلس رہے ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"88:5","textAr":"تُسۡقَىٰ مِنۡ عَيۡنٍ ءَانِيَةٖ","transliteration":"Tusqa min AAaynin aniyatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کھولتے ہوئے چشمے کا پانی انہیں پینے کو دیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"88:6","textAr":"لَّيۡسَ لَهُمۡ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِن ضَرِيعٖ","transliteration":"Laysa lahum taAAamun illa min dareeAAin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For them there will be no food except from a poisonous, thorny plant"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"خار دار سوکھی گھاس کے سوا کوئی کھانا اُن کے لیے نہ ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"88:7","textAr":"لَّا يُسۡمِنُ وَلَا يُغۡنِي مِن جُوعٖ","transliteration":"La yusminu wala yughnee min jooAAin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Which neither nourishes nor avails against hunger"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو نہ موٹا کرے نہ بھوک مٹائے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"88:8","textAr":"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ نَّاعِمَةٞ","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawmaithin naAAimatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Other] faces, that Day, will show pleasure"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کچھ چہرے اُس روز با رونق ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"88:9","textAr":"لِّسَعۡيِهَا رَاضِيَةٞ","transliteration":"LisaAAyiha radiyatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"With their effort [they are] satisfied"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اپنی کار گزاری پر خوش ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"88:10","textAr":"فِي جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٖ","transliteration":"Fee jannatin AAaliyatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In an elevated garden"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"عالی مقام جنت میں ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"88:11","textAr":"لَّا تَسۡمَعُ فِيهَا لَٰغِيَةٗ","transliteration":"La tasmaAAu feeha laghiyatan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Wherein they will hear no unsuitable speech"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کوئی بیہودہ بات وہاں نہ سنیں گے"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"88:12","textAr":"فِيهَا عَيۡنٞ جَارِيَةٞ","transliteration":"Feeha AAaynun jariyatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Within it is a flowing spring"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس میں چشمے رواں ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"88:13","textAr":"فِيهَا سُرُرٞ مَّرۡفُوعَةٞ","transliteration":"Feeha sururun marfooAAatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Within it are couches raised high"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس کے اندر اونچی مسندیں ہوں گی"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"88:14","textAr":"وَأَكۡوَابٞ مَّوۡضُوعَةٞ","transliteration":"Waakwabun mawdooAAatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And cups put in place"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ساغر رکھے ہوئے ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"88:15","textAr":"وَنَمَارِقُ مَصۡفُوفَةٞ","transliteration":"Wanamariqu masfoofatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And cushions lined up"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"گاؤ تکیوں کی قطاریں لگی ہوں گی"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"88:16","textAr":"وَزَرَابِيُّ مَبۡثُوثَةٌ","transliteration":"Wazarabiyyu mabthoothatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And carpets spread around"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور نفیس فرش بچھے ہوئے ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"88:17","textAr":"أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى ٱلۡإِبِلِ كَيۡفَ خُلِقَتۡ","transliteration":"Afala yanthuroona ila alibili kayfa khuliqat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then do they not look at the camels - how they are created"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(یہ لوگ نہیں مانتے) تو کیا یہ اونٹوں کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے بنائے گئے؟"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"88:18","textAr":"وَإِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيۡفَ رُفِعَتۡ","transliteration":"Waila alssamai kayfa rufiAAat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And at the sky - how it is raised"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"آسمان کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے اٹھایا گیا؟"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"88:19","textAr":"وَإِلَى ٱلۡجِبَالِ كَيۡفَ نُصِبَتۡ","transliteration":"Waila aljibali kayfa nusibat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And at the mountains - how they are erected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پہاڑوں کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے جمائے گئے؟"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"88:20","textAr":"وَإِلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ كَيۡفَ سُطِحَتۡ","transliteration":"Waila alardi kayfa sutihat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And at the earth - how it is spread out"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور زمین کو نہیں دیکھتے کہ کیسے بچھائی گئی؟"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"88:21","textAr":"فَذَكِّرۡ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٞ","transliteration":"Fathakkir innama anta muthakkirun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So remind, [O Muhammad]; you are only a reminder"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اچھا تو (اے نبیؐ) نصیحت کیے جاؤ، تم بس نصیحت ہی کرنے والے ہو"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"88:22","textAr":"لَّسۡتَ عَلَيۡهِم بِمُصَيۡطِرٍ","transliteration":"Lasta AAalayhim bimusaytirin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"You are not over them a controller"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کچھ ان پر جبر کرنے والے نہیں ہو"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"88:23","textAr":"إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ","transliteration":"Illa man tawalla wakafara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"However, he who turns away and disbelieves"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"البتہ جو شخص منہ موڑے گا اور انکار کرے گا"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"88:24","textAr":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلۡعَذَابَ ٱلۡأَكۡبَرَ","transliteration":"FayuAAaththibuhu Allahu alAAathaba alakbara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then Allah will punish him with the greatest punishment"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو اللہ اس کو بھاری سزا دے گا"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"88:25","textAr":"إِنَّ إِلَيۡنَآ إِيَابَهُمۡ","transliteration":"Inna ilayna iyabahum","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, to Us is their return"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِن لوگوں کو پلٹنا ہماری طرف ہی ہے"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"88:26","textAr":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيۡنَا حِسَابَهُم","transliteration":"Thumma inna AAalayna hisabahum","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then indeed, upon Us is their account"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اِن کا حساب لینا ہمارے ہی ذمہ ہے"}]}]}